  "examplesReference": [
   "sometimes, you’d like a little more. more baggage. more comfort in a higher travel class. more anticipation of delicious menus. treat yourself to your personal plus while preparing for your trip.",
   "the better the planning, the more memorable the experience – especially when the best hotel is waiting for you and your plan for excursions and tours is already in place. for even greater peace of mind, secure a rental car to get quickly and flexibly from a to b. all to ensure a stay that is tailor-made for you.",
   "all signs point to comfort here: reserve your favorite seats in advance for yourself and your travel companions, book a free neighbor seat, or on long-haul flights, enjoy an entire row of seats to yourself.",
   "whether you travel by train, by your own car, or stay digitally connected on the go: a range of services help make your journey to and from the airport, as well as your time at your destination, as comfortable as possible. travel with rail&fly from selected railway stations in germany directly to your flight and back again. if you arrive by car, you can reserve your airport parking space conveniently at the terminal. and with car sharing, you remain flexible and mobile at your destination. in addition, an esim ensures reliable connectivity throughout your trip.",
   "with the insurance packages from our partner, you are fully protected when you travel. if you require medical assistance on your journey, you will be in good hands with a companion from medical travel companions. and if you take temperature-sensitive medication, a special transport cube is available for them."
  ],
